---
import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
---
<ContentLayout title="Contact | StackGeist" description="Contact StackGeist for corrections, accessibility issues, and privacy questions.">
  <div class="legal-page">
    <p class="page-kicker">Contact</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Contact StackGeist</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">For corrections, accessibility issues, or privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:support@stackgeist.dev">support@stackgeist.dev</a>. Include the page URL and enough detail to explain the problem. Please do not email passwords, private documents, account tokens, or payment information.</p>
    <div class="contact-state">
      <h2>No contact form is collecting data.</h2>
      <p>Email is the contact channel; this website does not submit or store a contact form. StackGeist does not offer individual technical support or accept paid reviews or sponsored placements. A reply time is not guaranteed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-body">
      <section><h2>Product information</h2><p>Product specifications, compatibility, pricing, and availability can change. For a purchase decision, confirm current details with the manufacturer or retailer linked from the recommendation.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Commercial relationships</h2><p>StackGeist does not currently accept paid reviews or sponsored placement requests. Affiliate relationships are explained on the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a> page and near qualifying links.</p></section>
    </div>
  </div>
</ContentLayout>
